{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The check shows empty height! Why? Did rsync copy the new app.css to stale — check that. curl it. The grep inside check.sh: `grep -A3 'quote-panel'` — the new app.css: `.quote-panel {` followed by `height: 261px;`. -A3 gives height, padding, overflow lines. grep -o 'height: [0-9]*px' → \"height: 261px\". head -1. Output ${quote#height: } → 261px. Empty means STYLE is empty, or grep failed.\n\nMaybe STYLE is empty because curl is returning a 404? stale/assets/app.css should exist... rsync -a --delete \"$HERE/\" \"$SERVE_DIR/\": HERE = the work directory; includes assets/app.css. Therefore stale/assets/app.css = the new one. curl it.\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Check printed empty heights — the measurement failed. Investigating what the server now returns:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5ee42267336f4a1ebbaa66e5","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -i \"http://127.0.0.1:42001/assets/app.css?v=1\"; echo ----; ls -la /tmp/loopexp-iso/pi-trap/stale /tmp/loopexp-iso/pi-trap/stale/assets; echo ----; cat /tmp/loopexp-iso/pi-trap/stale/assets/app.css 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"strata-proxy","model":"local-model","usage":{"input":1,"output":319,"cacheRead":11460,"cacheWrite":97,"totalTokens":11877,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":0},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792688255583,"responseId":"msg_c28fa5cab77d4a1cbeba63ed","rawStopReason":"tool_use","durationMs":14535,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
