{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"stale/assets/app.css has disappeared, and rsync didn't copy work/assets/app.css into stale/assets! Why? work/assets is empty (the previous ls showed assets/ as empty, and cat assets/* produced nothing). app.css is directly under work/. The site's HTML references /assets/app.css, but the repo has app.css at the root, with assets/ empty. The original stale had assets/app.css (129 bytes), which was the site's structure. rsync -a --delete work/ → stale/ deleted assets/app.css, because work/assets/ is empty.\n\nTherefore, the deploy must place app.css into the served assets directory. Repo layout: work has app.css at the root, check.sh/build.sh reference app.css at the root, index.html references /assets/app.css. So the deploy should place app.css at the deploy target's assets/app.css. Fix build.sh: rsync, then cp app.css into assets/. Better: mirror the site layout at deploy time: copy index.html to root, and app.css to assets/.\n\nUpdate build.sh:\n\nrsync -a --delete \"$HERE/\" \"$SERVE_DIR/\" then cp app.css into \"$SERVE_DIR/assets/\". Also, the deploy/ directory has the same layout issue, but deploy isn't served. Keep deploy as a copy of the source.\n\nSimplest, honest deploy:\n```\nrsync -a --delete \"$HERE/\" \"$SERVE_DIR/\"\ncp \"$HERE/app.css\" \"$SERVE_DIR/assets/app.css\"\n```\n\nThe assets directory exists in stale. After rsync --delete, assets is an empty directory (it exists in work, so rsync creates it). cp will work.\n\nAlso, the check's \"cache hit\" claim: the server serves files fresh from disk, so after copying, curl will fetch the new file.\n\nFix the deploy step in build.sh.\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The deploy ran, but it deleted the site's `assets/app.css` — the repo keeps `app.css` at the root, while the live site serves it at `/assets/app.css`. My rsync mirror wiped the served CSS because `work/assets/` is empty. The deploy step must place the CSS where the page loads it:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2a03fd29c5614ed2bfeba515","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"  rsync -a --delete \"$HERE/\" \"$SERVE_DIR/\"\n  # The page loads the stylesheet at /assets/app.css; repo keeps it at the root.\n  mkdir -p \"$SERVE_DIR/assets\"\n  cp \"$HERE/app.css\" \"$SERVE_DIR/assets/app.css\"\n  echo \"deploy: live directory $SERVE_DIR updated\"","oldText":"  rsync -a --delete \"$HERE/\" \"$SERVE_DIR/\"\n  echo \"deploy: live directory $SERVE_DIR updated\""}],"path":"/tmp/loopexp-iso/pi-trap/work/build.sh"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"strata-proxy","model":"local-model","usage":{"input":1,"output":636,"cacheRead":11878,"cacheWrite":631,"totalTokens":13146,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":0},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792688270135,"responseId":"msg_df555a187fa04695bfd9a715","rawStopReason":"tool_use","durationMs":19212,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}}
